    {
      "id": 4,
      "key": "hero_subtitle",
      "value": "I'm a web developer and Data Analyst",
      "description": null,
      "createdAt": "2025-08-05T09:03:25.789Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-11-05T09:53:40.001Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "key": "about_text",
      "value": "<blockquote>\r\n<p>I&rsquo;m a <strong>Full-Stack Web Developer and Data &amp; AI Enthusiast</strong> focused on building responsive, reliable, and scalable web applications that solve real business problems. I work across both frontend and backend development, with hands-on experience in <strong>Python, Flask, PHP, JavaScript, React, MySQL, SQLite, and API integration</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I specialize in developing <strong>business websites, custom web applications, content-management systems, admin dashboards, database-driven platforms, and AI-powered features</strong>. From designing clean user interfaces to developing secure backend systems, database structures, authentication, form validation, and deployment, I can handle the complete development workflow.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>My experience includes projects in <strong>education, portfolio management, hospital management, parking systems, agriculture, and online services</strong>. I also have a strong interest in <strong>Data Science, data analysis, automation, prompt engineering, and AI integration</strong>, allowing me to combine traditional software development with modern intelligent solutions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I believe good development is more than writing code&mdash;it is about <strong>understanding requirements, creating a smooth user experience, writing maintainable code, and delivering a solution that provides real value</strong>. I&rsquo;m committed to clear communication, attention to detail, and continuous improvement throughout every project.</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\r\n",
      "description": null,
      "createdAt": "2025-08-05T09:03:25.806Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-08T08:28:36.431Z"
    },
