      "description": "<p><em>Worked with clients across various industries to design and develop custom web applications tailored to their business needs. Built dynamic websites using Flask and Django, incorporating features like user authentication, admin panels, contact forms, and content management systems.</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Specialized in creating responsive, mobile-friendly front-ends using HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, and JavaScript. Integrated REST APIs, third-party services (like payment gateways and email notifications), and optimized websites for performance and SEO.</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Communicated directly with clients to gather requirements, deliver updates, and provide post-launch support. Focused on delivering clean, maintainable code and intuitive user experiences.</em></p>\r\n",
